@startuml FR02_Login_Sequence
title FR-02 / UC-02.1 - Log In
autonumber
actor "Staff Member" as Staff
boundary "Client" as Client
control "AuthController" as Ctrl
control "AuthService" as Svc
database "Database" as DB
Staff -> Client: Enter and submit email and password
Client -> Ctrl: Submit login credentials
Ctrl -> Svc: Verify credentials and account activity
Svc -> DB: Retrieve user by email
DB --> Svc: User record or no matching user
Svc -> Svc: Verify credentials using stored password hash
alt Invalid credentials
  Svc --> Ctrl: Reject login
  Ctrl --> Client: Login rejection
  Client --> Staff: Display login rejection
else Valid credentials
  Svc -> Svc: Check account active state
  alt Inactive account
    Svc --> Ctrl: Reject login
    Ctrl --> Client: Login rejection
    Client --> Staff: Display login rejection
  else Active account
    Svc -> Svc: Establish session or token
    Svc --> Ctrl: Authentication result
    Ctrl --> Client: Session or token
    Client --> Staff: Login successful
  end
end
note over Svc, DB
  Passwords are stored as hashes.
  Initial accounts may be provisioned through seed data.
end note
@enduml